    "description": "The \u201cNorthern Gateway\u201d Initiative  transforms the Northern Province of Sri Lanka into a strategic economic powerhouse.The Northern Province must be reimagined as a Frontier Province, serving as a living laboratory for Growth-Led Development.By leveraging its proximity to the trillion-dollar economy of Southern India, the North can pioneer a Sub-national Economic Corridor.",
