    "md5": "d239efece57d8dd1a7786a7a86f3eb9c",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1280,
    "chunk_text": "Sierra Cables reinforces market leadership with robust growth and international reach\n\nBest Brand Exporter Award accepted by Sierra Cables Executive Director/CEO Harsha Jayatunga, Chief Operating Officer Nalaka Marasinghe and DGM Technical Support Saman Perera\n\nSierra Cables PLC is not simply reporting a strong nine-month performance. It is demonstrating the power of focus \u2014 on quality, credibility, and global competitiveness.\n\nFor the nine months ended 2025, the company delivered results that reinforce its leadership in Sri Lanka\u2019s cable manufacturing industry while steadily expanding its global footprint. Revenue reached Rs. 12 billion, a 68% increase over Rs. 7 billion recorded during the same period in 2024. Gross profit rose by 66% to Rs. 3.1 billion. Profit from operations increased 70% to Rs. 2.5 billion. While profit for the period more than doubled to Rs. 2.1 billion, reflecting a 105% increase. Earnings per share rose from Rs. 1.89 to Rs. 3.88, reinforcing the company\u2019s ability to deliver meaningful value to shareholders.\n\nEven as the company expanded rapidly, financial discipline remained a priority. Net finance costs declined by 29% to Rs. 101 million, supported by prudent capital management and exchange gains generated through export growth."
  },
