    "chunk_text": "US-Israeli War On Iran; Set Ablaze Gulf Countries\n\nOn Saturday 28 February\u00a0 2026 \u00a0United States\u2019 lawless President Donald Trump has fulfilled long standing Israeli dream by launching a joint US-Israeli military strike on\u00a0 Iran which refused to bow down to Israel in the way Arab dictators had done.\n\nPresident Donald Trump said that U.S seeks to eliminate Iran\u2019s nuclear and missile programs, destroy the country\u2019s navy, and change its leadership. Perhaps blackmailed\u00a0 (Epstein files) by Israeli Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu, declared war criminal by the International Court of Justice, Trump installed in power by Zionist billionaire Jewish\u00a0 lobby, launched this military strikes in violation of all international laws.\n\nIt was also not approved by US Congress which is essential to declare war on other countries. Within hours they killed more than 153 girls in a school in Tehran.\n\nIn the process Trump and Netanyahu also killed Iranian President Ayatollah Ali Khamenei and his family members. Religious leader Ayatollah Khameni is not an ordinary person. Iranians\u00a0 with a proud history of 7000 years behind them will never forgive this crime. It is matter of weeks and months before Trump and Netanyahu learn their lessons for committing this heinous crime.\n\nIran named Ayatollah Alireza Arafi to its interim leadership council on Sunday, which will be at the helm of the country after the supreme leader\u2019s killing. The interim council, which will also include the President and the head of the judiciary, will lead the country until the Assembly of Experts \u201celects a permanent leader\u00a0 \u201d.\n\nPresident Masoud Pezeshkian said the new leadership council \u201chas begun its work\u201d even as Iran fired missiles at targets in Israel and Gulf Arab states after vowing massive retaliation.\n\nTrump also tricked Iranians by calling for talks on nuclear program."
