    "chunk_text": "President Masoud Pezeshkian said the new leadership council \u201chas begun its work\u201d even as Iran fired missiles at targets in Israel and Gulf Arab states after vowing massive retaliation.\n\nTrump also tricked Iranians by calling for talks on nuclear program.\n\nIran does not have nuclear weapons. Israel has around 400 nuclear bombs. Iran abide by UN nuclear non proliferation treaty\u00a0 \u00a0 where as Israel has not subjected its nuclear facilities for UN inspection.\n\nOn July 14, 2015, after years of extensive diplomacy, Iran and the P5 countries plus Germany concluded the Joint Comprehensive Plan of Action (JCPOA) to ensure that Iran\u2019s nuclear program would remain exclusively peaceful. In return, economic sanctions on Iran were to be lifted. The JCPOA placed Iran\u2019s nuclear activities under strict and continuous scrutiny by the International Atomic Energy Agency and thereby ended the risk of a nuclear-arms breakout by Iran, a risk that Iran had consistently denied.\n\nEver since the\u00a0Islamic Revolution led by Ayatollah Ruhollh Khemoni overthrew the corrupt US stooge Shah\u00a0Mohammad Reza Pahlavi  dynasty\u00a0in 1979, Israel and its partners in crime in US-UK and Europe vowed to over this regime .\n\nThe new Islamic\u00a0regime adopted a fiercely independent policy opposing\u00a0 US-led western conspiracies. The US-UK-Europe and Israel together with their Arab partners subjected Iran to immense hardships by imposing economic sanctions and\u00a0 launching military strikes besides accusing Iran of terrorism which is the product of US led west to justify their wars on\u00a0 Muslim countries.\n\nThe Arab dictators openly and secretly sided with Israel and\u00a0 US led west against Iran causing untold hardships.However despite all the sufferings Iran continued its policy. for\u00a0 the past 48 years."
