    "md5": "9363c1f4cbe9b3307d7010d53550c087",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1735,
    "chunk_text": "Imperial Advisors of the WIS Group opens new office\n\nImperial Advisors, part of the WIS Group, a Sri Lankan company that provides Financial Solutions in the United Kingdom, has officially opened its Conveyancing office in Kohuwela.\n\nThe new office was ceremonially declared opened on the 2nd of February 2026 by WIS Group Co-Founder Ifthikar Mohamed to advance a unified Mortgage and Conveyancing approach for its growing client base. The office is designed to streamline and modernise the Conveyancing process by integrating technology-led solutions that reduce delays, minimise administrative exchanges, and deliver a clearer, faster, and more consistent experience for Advisors and clients. By aligning technology, expertise, and service delivery, Imperial Advisors aims to raise the standard of Conveyancing while supporting Advisors with a more efficient and transparent process.\n\nThe office is a key part of the wider WIS Group of companies, a one-stop Financial Services ecosystem that includes WIS Accountancy, WIS Mortgages and Insurance, and WIS Wealth. Together, the group offers a seamless approach to Financial, Mortgage, and Advisory Services across the UK. WIS Accountancy, a leading provider of Digital Accountancy, Bookkeeping, Tax, and Business Advisory services in the UK, is currently expanding its operations in both the UK and Sri Lanka. The launch of Imperial Advisors further strengthens the group\u2019s commitment to delivering integrated, technology-driven solutions that support clients throughout their financial and property journeys. The expansion is also expected to naturally drive job creation, presenting significant employment opportunities for prospective candidates, notably Sri Lankan law graduates."
