    "description": "Torpedo Attack by US Submarine Sinks Iranian  Frigate \u201cIRIS  Dena\u201d 40 Nautical Miles Off Sri Lanka\u2019s Southern  Coast: Two Lankan Navy  Vessels Respond to Dawn Distress Call and Rescue 32  Iranian Sailors Admitted to Galle Hospital;83 Bodies recovered by SL Navy.",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=87211",
