    "chunk_size_bytes": 1715,
    "chunk_text": "New Media Solutions emerges Most Awarded Corporate Communications Agency at Effie Awards 2026\n\nNew Media Solutions, a leading player in homegrown media, brand communications and public relations, recently secured multiple recognitions at the Effie Awards Sri Lanka, emerging as the most awarded traditional and digital corporate communications agency at this year\u2019s ceremony.\n\nThe agency won two Silver Effie Awards for the widely acclaimed \u2018Daintee Gingerbread House\u2019 campaign executed for Sunshine Consumer Lanka Ltd. (Daintee). The campaign also earned a Merit Effie Finalist recognition in another category, highlighting its strong creative strategy and measurable marketing effectiveness.\n\nIn addition, New Media Solutions\u2019 work on the \u2018My Zesta Story\u2019 campaign for Sunshine Consumer Lanka Ltd. (Zesta) received two Bronze Effie Awards, reflecting the campaign\u2019s success in driving consumer engagement and strengthening brand affinity through innovative storytelling and digital engagement.\n\nBeyond these wins, New Media Solutions also secured multiple Merit Effie Finalist recognitions for campaigns executed for Softlogic Life Insurance PLC, including the socially driven #LetsChangeTheStory initiative and seasonal campaigns such as \u2018Siduhath Upatha AR Asin Softlogic Life Vesak\u2019 and \u2018Flying Santa\u2019, which showcased the agency\u2019s ability to combine creative storytelling with innovative digital and experiential marketing approaches.\n\nCommenting on the recognition, New Media Solutions Managing Director Nilupa Sanjaya Liyanage said the awards reflect the agency\u2019s continued commitment to delivering impactful campaigns built on creativity, cultural relevance and strategic insight."
