    "description": "Sri Lanka Will Evacuate 208  Sailors  from Iranian Naval Ship \u201cIRINS Bushehr\u201d Stranded  Near Island Territorial Waters; Ship will  be Docked at Trincomalee Port While Crew would be taken to Cololmbo Announces President Dissanayake Emphasising  that Sri Lanka will continue to pursue a neutral foreign policy,",
