    "chunk_id": "2026-03-06-dbsjeyarajcom-517c74a4-0005",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "26d5f3f7c84a991d88f976c7d880e049",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 732,
    "chunk_text": "Salley is alleged to have aided and conspired in the Easter Sunday attacks. Do the investigators have any evidence against him beyond the claim of a whistleblower of Salley\u2019s involvement with a local Islamist group in a 2023 Channel 4 documentary?\n\nIndia brought visible judicial closure with the execution of terrorist Kasab, and took constructive action to improve the system. Sri Lanka\u2019s politically oriented process has interfered with the investigative process. This has skewed its systemic process affecting the handling of terror attacks. Will the arrest of Salley lead to final closure? One can only hope President Dissanayake is able to bring the Easter Sunday attack cases to a closure and punish the actual criminals."
  },
