    "description": "Iran Embassy in Colombo condemns \u2018military aggression\u2019 by Israel and US",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Iran-Embassy-in-Colombo-condemns-military-aggression-by-Israel-and-US/56-789161",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
