    "description": "Sri Lanka: The humanitarian pivot in emerging Indian Ocean crisis",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Sri-Lanka-The-humanitarian-pivot-in-emerging-Indian-Ocean-crisis/4-789225",
