    "chunk_text": "Maqara emerges as top Colombo dining spot\n\nMaqara Sri Lankan Restaurant, located opposite the World Trade Center, has become a premier culinary destination for both tourists and locals. A subsidiary of the Chinese Dragon Cafe Group, the venue is recognized for its authentic Sri Lankan breakfast and diverse Western options.\n\nIts signature lunch experience allows guests to customize rice and curry plates from over 10 traditional vegetable dishes. Dinner menus feature a blend of Sri Lankan and Chinese cuisine. The restaurant provides free delivery and caters bulk orders for corporate and family events, reinforcing its commitment to quality and convenience under the Chinese Dragon Cafe Group.\n\nFINEZ interior design brand partners Royal \u2013 Thomian cricket encounter for third consecutive year\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
