    "chunk_text": "There are obviously no easy answers, and any meaningful policy can only come out through political consensus. The fact that we need refuge in an energy grid in clear, but whose refuge we seek can only be decided through vigorous policy debates. Our energy woes are not just crises; they are catastrophes waiting to happen in a new era of global energy competition."
