    "description": "Renewed trade portal with India can supercharge Sri Lanka\u2019s exports",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Renewed-trade-portal-with-India-can-supercharge-Sri-Lanka-s-exports/14-789263",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
