    "description": "Israel unlawfully used white phosphorus in Lebanon: HRW",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Israel-unlawfully-used-white-phosphorus-in-Lebanon-HRW/56-789336",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
