    "description": "Rebuilding Sri Lankan cricket: A systems approach to sustainable high performance: Part II",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Rebuilding-Sri-Lankan-cricket-A-systems-approach-to-sustainable-high-performance-Part-II/4-789350",
